{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815050/extras/c955487e9e0b908be29d64eaf899197c.poster.avif?t=1646330757\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815050/extras/c955487e9e0b908be29d64eaf899197c.webm?t=1646330757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815050/extras/c955487e9e0b908be29d64eaf899197c.mp4?t=1646330757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Pick your team with 3 adventurers, explore and clean the dungeon! Cast your skill based on Color Matching to destroy incoming blocks with every round and try to damage the dungeon\u2019s boss when you can.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815050/extras/cf91bd995c9dad665bcc279aaffd8687.poster.avif?t=1646330757\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815050/extras/cf91bd995c9dad665bcc279aaffd8687.webm?t=1646330757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815050/extras/cf91bd995c9dad665bcc279aaffd8687.mp4?t=1646330757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Each adventurer had their own skill pattern to destroy the block, when the color is matched, will gain extra damage! Equip the rune in adventurer skill to make it stronger, and use the item when you feel danger.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815050/extras/8f6efe82b2a9ebbacfa0b3a385f5c7a1.poster.avif?t=1646330757\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com